m the criminal. Elias the half-blood, in whose veins the blood of the demon flows, may be the only hope of the Kingdom.\nExplore the lands of the Kingdom, fight hordes of demons and powerful bosses, find secrets, help inhabitants in distress and stop the impending catastrophe.\nGreat pixel graphics in SNES / Sega style;\nOriginal fantasy story;\nMetroidvania elements: various secondary weapons, equipable items, power ups;\nQuaint characters and enemies;\nExciting and challenging boss battles;\nKingdom events are revealed through dialogues, item descriptions, and game events."}